+| `go test ./... -race -count=1` | 0 | pass |
+| `go test ./... -cover -count=1` | 0 | pass; canonicaljson statement coverage 87.1% |
+| `go test ./internal/scalar -run '^$' -fuzz '^FuzzProductionScalarParsers$' -fuzztime=100x` | 0 | pass; baseline 37, total 38 |
+| `go test ./internal/canonicaljson -run '^$' -fuzz '^FuzzProductionCanonicalizationRoundTrip$' -fuzztime=100x` | 0 | pass; baseline 28, total 29 |
+| `go test ./internal/canonicaljson -run '^$' -fuzz '^FuzzProductionIdentityInvariant$' -fuzztime=100x` | 0 | pass; baseline 30, total 31 |
+| `go test ./internal/canonicaljson -run '^$' -fuzz '^FuzzProductionClosedShapeIdentity$' -fuzztime=100x` | 0 | pass; baseline 74, total 75 |
+| `.agents/bin/tracecheck` | 0 | pass; 60 contracts, 36 normative requirements, 29 acceptance criteria, 30 fixtures, 55 compatibility rows |
+| `.agents/bin/tracecheck -section 17.3` | 0 | pass; one Section 17.3 assignment |
+| `.agents/bin/cataloggen -check` | 0 | pass |
+| `GOOS=linux GOARCH=amd64 go build ./...` | 0 | pass |
+| `GOOS=windows GOARCH=amd64 go build ./...` | 0 | pass |
+| JSON fixture parse gate with `set -o pipefail` | 0 | pass |
+| `task-board validate` | 0 | command succeeded; it reported 262 inherited `MISSING_ACTIVITY` diagnostics elsewhere on the board, none for this task |
