+
+`CalculateObjectIdentity` / `VerifyObjectIdentity` -> `prepareObjectIdentity` -> `validateImmutableObjectShape` -> the schema-specific closed-shape validator.
+
+`internal/canonicaljson/closed_shapes.go` was not changed. Its SHA-256 remains `3d34cb52cb483e513a8ba398ed351993a02c46c01d5f4086af083f038304b307`.
