+
+- Added `internal/canonicaljson/clause_refusal_test.go`.
+- Updated `internal/canonicaljson/testdata/constraint-enumeration.md` so claimed cross-field and member-presence evidence names the executable public-entry tests.
+
+The tests drive both public identity entries and pin exact refusal reasons for invalid `env_literals` keys, Board Identity logical IDs and local URL nullability, WorkspaceSnapshot subject equality, Git ref/tagged-union rules, submodule case collisions and initialized-state invariants, pack/features format equality, and symlink/hardlink target types. A recursive deletion test walks every member of all 24 registered closed shapes represented by eight valid fixture families. A registry guard test proves that a registered schema cannot silently resolve to a nil validator.
